CM_ SG_ 331 x14b_BrkVacuumBoosterGaugePress "Vacuum Sensor reading from brake module. will be negative because its relative to baro. Obviously we disconnected it from the booster but the sensor still reads a value nonetheless. Not sure if the sensor is gauge or absolute pressure (would need to test at altitude) but I would guess gauge.

26dec = 98.4 kPa on MAP Sensor @ 98.4 Baro (0 kPa vacuum)
110dec = 32kPa on MAP Sensor @ 98.4 Baro   (66.4kPa vacuum)
137dec when vacuum pump runs (unknown actual pressure) so its not a signed number
";
